<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Chatham, Mass., $6.9 million of General Obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Michigan refunding, $22.76 million of revenue bonds.</p>
<p>-Waldwick, N.J., $2.985 million improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Kendall, Texas, $4.9 million Certificates of Obligation.</p>
<p>--Virginia Housing Development Authority, $78.5 million of revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
